Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)鲨鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)是你们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了你？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}声音太大了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)样子跟平时不太一样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)被追了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)他居然警戒到这种程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那女孩是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 太可爱了。我不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.97,0:00:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)真是的 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明人家一直期待着跟你一起去学校的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然丢下我自己走 太过分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.37,0:00:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 你是鲨鱼的妹妹的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今天开始从今天起要来上学了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和哥哥凌牙一起还请多多关照。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的妹妹不过也行。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是双形态派！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过也行～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(爱华)也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把九十九游马的 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺过来就好了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)嗯 还有一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙的 No.也一并。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来 神代凌牙的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像来学校了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)是吗 妹妹就是那家伙的弱点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就把妹妹控制在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后直接击溃神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。一切都是为了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)为了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)可是璃绪同学你没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明住院住了那么久这么快就回学校了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 而且凌牙那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是我不跟着他真的不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天早上还睡过头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.37,0:03:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}穿着睡衣就想出门。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？鲨鱼睡过头？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 而且。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别那样喋喋不休地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说些多余的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我对你……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没 没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 你呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和凌牙决斗赢了的那个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你认识我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的，是天城海斗先生吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:04:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，不对我是九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊，就是那个光靠气势
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偶尔靠运气赢的那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个游马先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃，我记得口头禅是冲吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～ 要冲了哦，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，原来是这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}午餐时间，我先失陪了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(八咫乌)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，找得我好苦啊，神代璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找我有什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是足球部部长八咫乌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}务必想请你来我们足球部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}担任经理啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请务必来网球部！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来柔道部吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那真是荣幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么放学后我会去各位的社团拜访。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好、好的～
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～璃绪同学简直就像太阳一样的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，开什么玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙哪是太阳，分明是冰之女。你迟早会明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:04:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个人要对付全体正式队员。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说璃绪同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是自己的球被拦下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就去做经理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她好像这么宣言了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)那根本不可能嘛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了约好的事可要给我遵守哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然。我上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(主播)已经快到终点了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位 就凭这点实力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就想让我当经理？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是想让我当经理的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就请先练出与之相称的实力再说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真厉害啊 让人热血沸腾。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢夸奖。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是一点都不可爱啊。简直就是女鲨鱼啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得真过分。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管他们就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些只把女性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当成部门装饰品的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！璃绪小姐就是我理想中的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊你为什么要做到这种地步？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我是神代凌牙的妹妹……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？因为你是鲨鱼的妹妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我听说对凌牙没有好感的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我太弱，可能有人会拿我当盾牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以此来抓住凌牙的软肋趁虚而入。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我必须变强。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代璃绪小姐……是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失礼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们华道部部长爱华大人叫您过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请您移步到部室。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（爱华）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎您光临。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:07:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是部长花添爱华。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是叫璃绪来着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎拥有非常出色的才能呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剪得那么狠花也太可怜了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}花真正的美是在去除多余之物时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才会诞生的，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…游马，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，看看周围！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这到底是怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来她是通过剪花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来施加催眠术的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能想到的答案只有一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她是巴利安的刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大、大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了巴利安世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来想从神代璃绪开始{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是从你开始让我来将你击溃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我决斗如果你赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代璃绪我就放过她。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！ 来吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊痛痛 腿麻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太嫩了，九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来做你的对手吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没被催眠术控制住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就觉得有点不对劲所以装作被控制了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耍这种小聪明呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}退下吧 妹妹鲨这些家伙是屏障者。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是你打得过的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的身子 自己来守护。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 由我来接。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.87,0:08:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思 那就来决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻就由在下拿下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将火铳花以攻击表示召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动 场地魔法发动枯山水！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这片场地上 水属性怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击将会无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 对手的卡组是设想了与鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之间的战斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 当场地上有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.97,0:09:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只植物族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将1只植物族怪兽\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 炮战花！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当场地上有2只以上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}植物族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将同为植物族的宇宙花从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然就来了3只等级3的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级3的火铳花 炮战花
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宇宙花来进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以3只怪兽构建超量网络，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在此献上。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绽放吧 烈华炮舰 抚子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 枯山水的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽额外卡组是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1阶级100点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 抚子的怪兽效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方每有1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}300点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奉上。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的手牌是5张。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此吃下1500的伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.19,0:11:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大花野云！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 我 盖1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.11,0:11:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤花式猎鹰。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 暴风鹰爪！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合期间 场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性 以及 鸟兽族怪兽1只的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以提升1500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻…攻击力3000。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺能干的嘛 妹妹鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵 你忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这片场地上 由于枯山水的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽的攻击将会无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:11:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没忘哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 暴风猎鹰的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 当攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比原本攻击力增加的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以给予对方玩家 那个数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来目标是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害啊。是这么打算的么。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上三张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧，神代璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比我想的还能干嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三张盖卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来相当害怕那美西子的效果呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减少手牌，来减少伤害是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，以她的性格。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些盖卡肯定有什么名堂。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你好好体会一下与我为敌的愚蠢吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动升阶魔法 魅影之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在此发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用烈华炮舰 那美西子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是现身之时伟大之巴利安的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.85,0:13:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绽放吧，混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激烈华战舰 多矢芽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管来什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借枯山水的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽超量们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级×100点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升是也。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多矢芽的怪兽效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个混沌超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场上的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}包括怪兽在内共4张。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上有3张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃… 4张和3张的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是2800的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.67,0:14:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 畏惧抚子的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把大量手牌盖放起来反倒成了败因呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在田忌的效果发动之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻石·尘爆已经发动了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡会把场上存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽全部破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我的场上的卡变成了2张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}合计就变成了2000的伤害哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.29,0:14:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每破坏1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会给对手造成500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也太猛了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 生命值只剩500。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 这次一定让我来给你致命一击吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就请你吃一记
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.18,0:15:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塔奥娅梅的直击吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少废话！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 冰之锁链！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只等级4以下的水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 极光翼以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}极光翼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在被战斗破坏的那个回合仅有一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是死缠烂打呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束这回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！ 看来你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勉强撑住了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就看你能撑到什么时候。呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡「死者苏生」！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.48,0:15:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤「喷霞隼」！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱卡「蔷薇的墓标」！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，当对方场上的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送上300点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}聊表心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊！这样一来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就没法发动卡片了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还以为你能稍微华丽地退场呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终究不过是那个粗野卑贱的神代凌牙的妹妹。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是缺乏品性。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有种再说一遍啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说凌牙粗野又卑贱你是这么说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我暂且不论但我不允许你说凌牙的坏话。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心我把你冻住。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的急冻鸟·隼和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}极光翼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧，零鸟兽 希尔菲妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相当美丽的怪兽呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这样是赢不了我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？由于你的枯山水的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希尔菲妮的攻击力每1个阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升100点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，发动希尔菲妮的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下个自己的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除这张卡以外的表侧卡片效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后每有一张被无效的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以让对手一只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降300点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完美冻结！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表侧表示的卡合计有3张。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 田尾山的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降900点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 枯山水的效果被无效了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每提升1阶级就增加100的攻击力恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你的碍事卡片就被冻住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好 妹妹鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别说了 那个妹妹鲨太土了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 那个 那这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简称芋鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 回头再制裁你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞舞吧 希尔菲涅！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击陶俑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了。速攻魔法 花裁斩发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怪兽的效果对象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能是表侧表示的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放的卡 还是可以用的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.83,0:18:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只植物族超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把所有超量素材送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力提升800。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成3100！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！冰之世界也不过是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终究只是衬托花朵色彩的背景罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下真正的冰之世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌发动速攻魔法发动绝对零度！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在没有超量单位的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只怪兽超量怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对零度是白银中的黑暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冻结的花瓣也碎裂散落。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会 我的混沌超量怪兽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 希尔菲妮 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击陶俑！冰之射线！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了 鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样 不行吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 呃～ 呃～{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼兄弟！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 兄弟不是妹妹而是弟弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪… 哪个都行吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我住院期间凌牙变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得被人畏惧听说变成了那样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 说实话 很害怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 凌牙完全 没有变。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是因为有你在也说不定。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代璃绪 是个不能大意的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和九十九游马一起 这次一定要…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 什么时候睡着的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 璃绪小姐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)还算不错的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！ 从什么时候开始的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一开始就在。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一直在看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要建议吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)嘿 在我们睡着的时候 进行决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪姐 下次也请教我怎么玩决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很乐意。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是为你好才……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 你妹妹也太强了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还差得远呢虽然还有不成熟的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 No.卡的鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用预言般话语的璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代兄妹到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猫！猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪姐 你怕猫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明这么可爱？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快把它赶走啦 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.89,0:22:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不需要我帮忙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害怕的璃绪大人也……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙真坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.85,0:23:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.28,0:23:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.08,0:24:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
